WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.164
Kusheh en welkom to di government modules tour.

2
00:00:03.164 --> 00:00:14.572
SaloneHCM in Gov tier de add di control dem wey public payroll demand: civil service salary structure, establishment discipline, budget check before money move, en public transparency.

3
00:00:14.572 --> 00:00:15.874
Mek wi tour each one.

4
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:22.522
Di civil service module de hold yu grade en step salary matrix, allowance rule dem, en budget code dem.

5
00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:32.448
Salary de flow from di structure — no be from ad-hoc number — so grade seven step three officer na Bo de earn exactly wetin di structure talk, same as na Freetown.

6
00:00:32.448 --> 00:00:35.858
Retro-pay en ghost-worker audit tool dem de live ya too.

7
00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:43.349
Establishment control de compare approved post dem against filled post dem, ministry by ministry.

8
00:00:43.349 --> 00:00:50.642
Over-establishment hiring de flag before e turn payroll liability, en vacancy dem de visible for workforce planning.

9
00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:21.657
Before any payroll run commit, di budget check de verify say allocation still de na every budget code wey di run go use.

10
00:01:21.657 --> 00:01:27.583
If one code don pass, di run de block — en na only documented override with reason able proceed.

11
00:01:27.583 --> 00:01:32.706
Na di payroll page, di budget balances panel de show exactly usai every code stand.

12
00:01:54.250 --> 00:02:05.764
Finally, di open-gov transparency portal — public page, no login need — wey de publish aggregate payroll statistics for yu ministry: headcount, wage bill trend dem, en grade distribution.

13
00:02:05.764 --> 00:02:10.690
Citizen en journalist dem de see di number dem; personal data de stay protected.

14
00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:18.682
Structure, establishment, budget discipline, en daylight — di four pillar dem of clean government payroll.

15
00:02:18.682 --> 00:02:23.962
Go take di government modules quiz na di Training Center for complete yu certification.
